        "created_at": "2013-10-26T00:09:23.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Just to check - when Fixed Point wears off and your styles/tools suddenly go \"oops, there's two of us - one of us has to go!\", can you choose which one, or would the one that was out first be automatically \"butted out\" by the more recent arrival as though you'd only just played it (the newer card)?</p>",
