      {
        "id": 67691,
        "name": "Matchstickman",
        "username": "Matchstickman",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/matchstickman/{size}/1880_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-10-26T00:17:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Neither.</p><p>The tools don't 'check for target destruction after every action' like Bounties, they have an instruction on the card that triggers when they enter play, after that they no longer check. if you were to play another tool after Fixed Point goes away, then the new tool's card text would trigger and remove all the 'excess' ones.</p><p>Same with Styles.</p>",
        "post_number": 127,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:45:47.145Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
