        "username": "phantaskippy",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-10-26T02:06:10.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Yes, with the right setup you can get a ton of his cards in play in one round or fixed point. &nbsp;Jackhandle/Hoistchain/Crowbars with Crane/Tiger/Monkey was the best I've pulled off. &nbsp;Absolutely insane how badly Akash got stomped after that.</p><p>Of course we set the game up to pull that off, and it involved Adept destroying that song to get him a lot of extra plays, and vernal set up Omni-X for the last one, Visionary was working the decks to set it all up.</p>",
