      {
        "id": 67693,
        "name": "Ameena",
        "username": "Ameena",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-10-26T10:55:29.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Oh wow, that's cool :D. So to take full advantage of it, I suppose you would need someone who could let Fixer get out as much stuff as possible outside of his turn. Tiger Claw, Riveting Crane, and Jack Handle would be just epic against someone like Voss or Apostate &gt;:). Actually, I suppose if he had the Crowbars out as well, it'd be even more stupidly powerful, even if he has no damage buffs. I have to try this some time :D.</p>",
