        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-10-26T19:15:52.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Had Harmony out as well, so Fixer dealt 4 irreducible damage of any type to all Non-Hero targets, lowering their damage by one and making all damage to them irreducible. &nbsp;Then immediately did it again.</p><p>I got the chance to overdrive and it was barely even worth it, everything was dead after the first strike.</p>",
